# The glazed nose top: forward of the cab joint the elevation's dark roof band is the windscreen (black glass in the
# Oaris photo, glass reflecting the street in Flickr 54211015376), so it is glass on every version.
d.clip('cap', f'M{ex(CAB_JOINT):.1f},{ROOF - 12} H{TIP + 14} V{BASE + 12} H{ex(CAB_JOINT):.1f} Z')
d.group('cap')
